  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.55,
      "end_seconds": 6.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Doctor, your next patient is here. I've done the basics, I'll read them out in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.98,
      "end_seconds": 12.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Okay, thanks. Hi, how can I help today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.45,
      "end_seconds": 21.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "Mainly trouble falling asleep. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.63,
      "end_seconds": 26.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.08,
      "end_seconds": 32.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "I'd say about three months. Actually, no, closer to about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.22,
      "end_seconds": 37.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Is it worse at certain times?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.94,
      "end_seconds": 40.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "it's worse with screens"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.15,
      "end_seconds": 44.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "have you been waking tired?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.07,
      "end_seconds": 62.45,
      "duration_seconds": 16.38,
      "text": "Yeah, that too. And there's a busy mind at night as well, about a month now. With busy mind at night, maybe a eight out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.16,
      "end_seconds": 67.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.72,
      "end_seconds": 72.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I've, I've had an enlarged prostate, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.12,
      "end_seconds": 77.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.29,
      "end_seconds": 81.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Gout, for about a year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.0,
      "end_seconds": 95.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "alright, gout, that matches what I have here has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.19,
      "end_seconds": 108.61,
      "duration_seconds": 12.42,
      "text": "hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic but I couldn't tell you what it it was called or what it did"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.26,
      "end_seconds": 118.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.38,
      "end_seconds": 123.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "I'm on tamsulosin, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.5,
      "end_seconds": 129.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.51,
      "end_seconds": 155.9,
      "duration_seconds": 25.39,
      "text": "0.4 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box i take febuxostat, 80 milligrams, once a day for the gout though honestly, some days I forget to take it um, I'm on a herbal sleep tea, at night work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.37,
      "end_seconds": 167.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.21,
      "end_seconds": 172.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.18,
      "end_seconds": 175.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.63,
      "end_seconds": 178.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.97,
      "end_seconds": 183.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Right, are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.23,
      "end_seconds": 188.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.06,
      "end_seconds": 192.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.15,
      "end_seconds": 196.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.38,
      "end_seconds": 201.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.63,
      "end_seconds": 205.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.43,
      "end_seconds": 222.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.81,
      "end_seconds": 225.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.45,
      "end_seconds": 230.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Any weight change or low mood at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.6,
      "end_seconds": 236.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I haven't had weight change or low mood, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.73,
      "end_seconds": 240.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Any snoring or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.07,
      "end_seconds": 246.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "No snoring or chest pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.38,
      "end_seconds": 249.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.85,
      "end_seconds": 252.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 256.86,
      "end_seconds": 269.29,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temperature is 36.5 degrees, pulse is 80 beats a minute, SpO2 97 percent on room air, blood pressure 118 over 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.33,
      "end_seconds": 271.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.46,
      "end_seconds": 276.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "could you come over to the the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.8,
      "end_seconds": 278.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.47,
      "end_seconds": 283.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.01,
      "end_seconds": 299.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "your blood pressure and pulse are normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.61,
      "end_seconds": 314.69,
      "duration_seconds": 13.08,
      "text": "Right, you can sit up now. Okay, so my impression is this: I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be poor sleep habits, or it might be mild anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.41,
      "end_seconds": 319.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.05,
      "end_seconds": 333.68,
      "duration_seconds": 12.63,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like poor sleep habits. Keep a fixed bedtime, no screens for an hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.14,
      "end_seconds": 348.42,
      "duration_seconds": 14.28,
      "text": "Right, right. If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.93,
      "end_seconds": 350.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.74,
      "end_seconds": 355.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.33,
      "end_seconds": 359.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}